---
manual: list_box.change
lines: [3211, 3215]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $picked = []
  @fruit = list_box items: ["Grapes", "Pears", "Apricots"], choose: "Grapes"
  @fruit.change { $picked << @fruit.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on list_box
assert_empty $picked, "opening the list is not a change"

click_on "Pears"
assert_equal ["Pears"], $picked, "clicking an item calls the change block"
assert_equal "Pears", list_box.text
